### Goal Model for Multi-Robot Food Delivery and Dirty Dish Retrieval

The goal model is designed to manage the delivery of food and the retrieval of dirty dishes in a hospital setting, considering both autonomous and cooperative tasks.

---

### Goals

| **Name** | **GOAL_ID: GOAL_TEXT** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Relation** |
|----------|-------------------------|-------------|---------------|--------------|
| **G1**   | Manage Food Delivery and Dirty Dish Retrieval | - | Achieve | - |
| **G2**   | Deliver Food | - | Achieve | AND (G3) |
| **G3**   | Retrieve Dirty Dishes | - | Achieve | AND (G2) |
| **G2.1** | Deliver Food Directly | - | Perform | OR (G2.2) |
| **G2.2** | Deliver Food via Tray | - | Perform | OR (G2.2.1, G2.2.2, G2.2.3, G2.2.4) |
| **G2.3** | Track Meal Retrieval | - | Perform | AND (G2.2) |
| **G2.2.1** | Inpatient Retrieves Food | - | Perform | - |
| **G2.2.2** | Companion Visitor Retrieves Food | - | Perform | - |
| **G2.2.3** | Nurse Retrieves Food | - | Perform | - |
| **G2.2.4** | Another Robot Retrieves Food | - | Perform | - |
| **G3.1** | Retrieve Dishes Directly | - | Perform | OR (G3.2) |
| **G3.2** | Retrieve Dishes via Cooperation | - | Perform | OR (G3.2.1, G3.2.2, G3.2.3, G3.2.4) |
| **G3.2.1** | Inpatient Assists | - | Perform | - |
| **G3.2.2** | Companion Visitor Assists | - | Perform | - |
| **G3.2.3** | Nurse Assists | - | Perform | - |
| **G3.2.4** | Another Robot Assists | - | Perform | - |

---

### Tasks

| **Name** | **TASK_ID: TASK_NAME** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** |
|----------|-------------------------|--------------|--------------|-----------------------|
| **AT1**  | Move to Kitchen | AND (G2.1) | Kitchen | 1 |
| **AT2**  | Pick Up Meal | AND (G2.1) | Kitchen | 1 |
| **AT3**  | Move to Patient Room | AND (G2.1) | Patient Room | 1 |
| **AT4**  | Deliver Meal | AND (G2.1) | Patient Room | 1 |
| **AT5**  | Signal Meal Retrieval | AND (G2.3) | Patient Room | 1 |
| **AT6**  | Alert Wrong Meal | AND (G2.3) | Patient Room | 1 |
| **AT7**  | Move to Dish Station | AND (G3.1) | Dish Station | 1 |
| **AT8**  | Pick Up Dirty Dishes | AND (G3.1) | Dish Station | 1 |
| **AT9**  | Move to Patient Room for Dishes | AND (G3.1) | Patient Room | 1 |
| **AT10** | Retrieve Dishes | AND (G3.1) | Patient Room | 1 |
| **AT11** | Signal Dish Retrieval | AND (G3.2) | Patient Room | 1 |

---

### Summary of Logical Relationships

- **G1** -> **G2**, **G3** [AND]
- **G2** -> **G2.1**, **G2.2** [OR]
- **G2.2** -> **G2.2.1**, **G2.2.2**, **G2.2.3**, **G2.2.4** [OR]
- **G2.2** -> **G2.3** [AND]
- **G3** -> **G3.1**, **G3.2** [OR]
- **G3.2** -> **G3.2.1**, **G3.2.2**, **G3.2.3**, **G3.2.4** [OR]

This model ensures that the system can handle both food delivery and dish retrieval efficiently, considering various cooperative scenarios and tracking necessary actions.
